{"ticker":{"symbol":"121890.KQ","name":"에스디시스템","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2580.0,"change_pct":-0.01526717557251911,"market_cap":34291931136.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":2995.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"South Korea","city":"Seongnam-si","employees":null,"website":"https://www.sdsystem.co.kr","business_summary":"SD SYSTEM Co., Ltd engages in the development, manufacture, and sale of intelligent traffic management systems (ITS) and integrated control center systems (CCTV) in South Korea. The company also offers self-driving services, emergency rescue standard systems, video integration software architecture solutions, fee collection services, OBU products, and parking systems. It also provides parking management system, system manufacturing, installation work, and SW development services, as well as customization of toll collection design, manufacturing, development, installation, and maintenance services. The company was founded in 2001 and is headquartered in Seongnam-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"에스디시스템(주)는 한국에서 지능형 교통관리시스템(ITS)과 통합관제센터시스템(CCTV)을 개발, 제조, 판매하는 회사입니다. 이 회사는 또한 자율주행 서비스, 긴급 구조 표준 시스템, 비디오 통합 소프트웨어 아키텍처 솔루션, 요금 징수 서비스, OBU 제품 및 주차 시스템을 제공합니다. 또한, 주차관리 시스템, 시스템 제작, 설치공사, SW 개발 서비스를 제공하며, 통행료 징수 설계, 제작, 개발, 설치, 유지보수 등의 맞춤형 서비스도 제공하고 있습니다. 2001년에 설립된 회사로 대한민국 성남시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"산업기계","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":22496607370.0,"operating_income":-730035910.0,"net_income":-602631970.0,"eps":-55.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":21295259280.0,"operating_income":1029631390.0,"net_income":2637243720.0,"eps":208.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":18063667400.0,"operating_income":-2164577860.0,"net_income":-1827230150.0,"eps":-1